Team,

Today's discovery synthesis keeps the M-27 decision focused on four themes: first-value arrival, permission understanding, notification fatigue, and export confidence.

We will test a guided path with 16 synthetic workspaces from July 20-31. The baseline is 18.4% adoption; the Q3 target is 26.0% across 1,240 synthetic workspaces. The guided rollout gate remains September 18, 2026.

Decision criteria: faster first outcomes, at least 80% permission comprehension, notification opt-out at or below 12%, and export confidence of at least 4/5.

Regards,
Product Alpha PM

